# Force LF line endings for all text files, regardless of the client's
# core.autocrlf setting. Without this, editors/tools on Windows checkouts
# (or CIFS/SMB mounts served from a Windows host) silently rewrite every
# line to CRLF, turning every `git diff` into a whole-file noise diff that
# buries the actual change.
* text=auto eol=lf
